{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8d1cc890-badd-47dc-b160-606a31cdc066",
    "name": "Portfolio Admin API",
    "description": "Private Go API behind https://rifkiananda.vercel.app/admin.\n\nContract: docs/api-contract.md and docs/openapi.yaml in the repository.\n\n## How to use\n1. Import this collection and the environments.\n2. Pick an environment and fill in `admin_password` (stored as a secret, current value only).\n3. Run the folders in order, or run the whole collection with the Collection Runner.\n\nThe collection pre-request script sends the saved session cookie (`session_cookie`) on every request, so it works even where Postman's cookie jar would not send a Secure cookie (http://localhost).\n\n⚠️ Folder 4 commits to GitHub and triggers a deployment. Untick it in the runner on Production.\n\nPreview deployments can be protected by Vercel Authentication. If Preview requests return a Vercel login page, create a 'Protection Bypass for Automation' secret in Vercel (Project → Settings → Deployment Protection) and put it in the environment's `vercel_bypass` variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Send the saved admin session cookie, if any.",
          "const session = pm.collectionVariables.get('session_cookie');",
          "if (session) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Cookie', value: 'admin_session=' + session });",
          "}",
          "// Preview deployments may sit behind Vercel Deployment Protection.",
          "const bypass = pm.environment.get('vercel_bypass');",
          "if (bypass) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'x-vercel-protection-bypass', value: bypass });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
